# 实体开发（Forge 1.14.4）

## Decision: 实体类型选择

| 场景 | 基类 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|
| 基础生物（动物/怪物） | `Animal` / `MobEntity` | 支持 AI Goal |
| 站立型实体 | `LivingEntity` | 支持装备栏 |
| 投掷物 | `ThrowableEntity` | 支持重力 |
| 物品实体 | `ItemEntity` | 物品掉落物 |
| 矿车/船只 | `AbstractMinecart` / `BoatEntity` | 载具 |
| 显示实体 | `AreaEffectCloudEntity` | 药水云等 |

## EntityType 注册

```java
public static final EntityType<MyEntity> MY_ENTITY =
    EntityType.Builder.create(MyEntity::new, EntityClassification.CREATURE)
        .size(0.6f, 1.8f)              // 碰撞箱宽高
        .trackingRange(5)                // 追踪范围
        .updateInterval(3)               // 更新间隔（tick）
        .fireImmune()                    // 火焰免疫
        .build("my_entity");

@SubscribeEvent
public static void onEntitiesRegistry(final RegistryEvent.Register<EntityType> event) {
    event.getRegistry().register(
        MY_ENTITY.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_entity"))
    );
}
```

## LivingEntity 实体结构

```java
public class MyEntity extends LivingEntity {
    protected MyEntity(EntityType<? extends LivingEntity> type, World world) {
        super(type, world);
        this.noPhysics = false;
    }

    // 注册属性（必须重写）
    @Override
    protected void registerAttributes() {
        super.registerAttributes();
        this.getAttribute(SharedMonsterAttributes.MAX_HEALTH).setBaseValue(20.0);
        this.getAttribute(SharedMonsterAttributes.MOVEMENT_SPEED).setBaseValue(0.3);
        this.getAttribute(SharedMonsterAttributes.ATTACK_DAMAGE).setBaseValue(3.0);
        this.getAttribute(SharedMonsterAttributes.FOLLOW_RANGE).setBaseValue(16.0);
        this.getAttribute(SharedMonsterAttributes.ARMOR).setBaseValue(0.0);
    }

    // 注册 AI Goal（可选）
    @Override
    protected void registerGoals() {
        super.registerGoals();
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(0, new SwimGoal(this));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(1, new MeleeAttackGoal(this, 1.0, true));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(2, new WaterAvoidingRandomWalkingGoal(this, 1.0));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(3, new LookAtGoal(this, PlayerEntity.class, 8.0f));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(4, new LookRandomlyGoal(this));

        this.targetSelector.addGoal(0, new NearestAttackableTargetGoal<>(this, PlayerEntity.class, true));
    }

    // 实体 tick（每 tick 执行）
    @Override
    public void livingTick() {
        super.livingTick();
        // 实体逻辑
    }
}
```

## AI Goal 参考

| Goal | 用途 |
|------|------|
| `SwimGoal` | 游泳 |
| `MeleeAttackGoal` | 近战攻击 |
| `RangedAttackGoal` | 远程攻击 |
| `WaterAvoidingRandomWalkingGoal` | 随机游荡 |
| `LookAtGoal` | 注视玩家/实体 |
| `LookRandomlyGoal` | 随机转头 |
| `BreedGoal` | 繁殖（Animal 子类） |
| `FollowParentGoal` | 跟随父实体（Animal 子类） |

## EntityRenderer 注册（客户端）

```java
// FMLClientSetupEvent 中注册
@Mod.EventBusSubscriber(modid = MOD_ID, value = Dist.CLIENT, bus = Mod.EventBusSubscriber.Bus.MOD)
public class ClientSetup {
    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void setup(final FMLClientSetupEvent event) {
        RenderingRegistry.registerEntityRenderingHandler(
            ModEntities.MY_ENTITY,
            MyEntityRenderer::new
        );
    }
}

// 渲染器
public class MyEntityRenderer extends RenderLivingEntity<MyEntity> {
    public MyEntityRenderer(EntityRendererManager renderManager) {
        super(renderManager, new MyEntityModel<>(), 0.5f);
        // 添加图层（如物品手持层）
        this.addLayer(new ItemLayerRenderer<>(this, renderManager.getItemRenderer()));
    }

    @Override
    protected ResourceLocation getEntityTexture(MyEntity entity) {
        return new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "textures/entity/my_entity.png");
    }
}
```

## 实体 NBT 数据

```java
@Override
public void writeAdditional(NBTTagCompound compound) {
    super.writeAdditional(compound);
    compound.putInt("health", Math.floor(this.getHealth()));
}

@Override
public void readAdditional(NBTTagCompound compound) {
    super.readAdditional(compound);
    this.setHealth(compound.getFloat("health"));
}
```

## 常见错误

- ❌ `EntityType.Builder.create()` 第一个参数是构造函数引用，不是实例
- ❌ 忘记 `registerAttributes()` → 实体属性全为默认值
- ❌ `RenderingRegistry`（1.14.4）vs `EntityRenderersEvent`（1.16.5+）：注意事件类型
- ❌ `RenderLivingEntity`（1.14.4）vs `RenderLiving`（不存在）
- ❌ 在服务端调用 `RenderingRegistry`（必须 `Dist.CLIENT`）
- ❌ Entity Spawn Egg 需要手动注册 `SpawnEggItem`
